      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "The most reliable sign you need a new roof in Utah is an age of 20 years or older, especially since extreme temperature swings and intense UV exposure accelerate wear.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "an age of 20 years or older"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Common Signs You Need a New Roof"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Advanced Age: Asphalt shingle roofs older than 20 years are nearing the end of their lifespan. \u201cUtah's extreme temperature swings, intense UV exposure, and occasional hail storms can reduce the expected lifespan of roofing materials.\u201d-- [Homer Roofing ].",
            "snippet_links": [
              {
                "text": "Homer Roofing",
                "link": "https://homerroofing.net/learning-center/5-signs-your-roof-needs-repair-or-replacement/"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Curling or Buckling Shingles: Edges turning upward or bubbling in the middle mean the shingles have suffered moisture or heat damage."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Granules in Gutters: Finding dark, sand-like granules in your downspouts means your shingles are losing their protective coating against UV rays."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Missing or Cracked Shingles: Widespread missing or broken tabs leave your home exposed to water leaks and heavy winds."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Sagging Roof Deck: A drooping or wavy roofline indicates severe structural damage and rotted wood sheathing underneath."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Water Stains Inside: Dark spots or stains on your ceiling or walls often point to an active, persistent leak."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Watch this short overview to learn more about identifying roof damage and the top warning signs of failure:"
